{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the end! Lovecraftian horrors started appearing from nowhere, almost completely destroying human life existing on this planet. Take control of last few survivors to fight back against monsters and abominations!\u00a0Can you save what is left of this doomed world or is it too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Action Packed Platforming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum is the key! Combine your abilities to reach insane speeds and conquer hard-to-reach monster infested locations. Use your sword not only for protecting yourself but also as a way of speeding up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985860/extras/ed6cacb636f392f1e768c7a56c66184d.poster.avif?t=1774274942\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985860/extras/ed6cacb636f392f1e768c7a56c66184d.webm?t=1774274942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985860/extras/ed6cacb636f392f1e768c7a56c66184d.mp4?t=1774274942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Unique Builds With Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain new abilities by defeating your enemies. Collect enough upgrades and you will see yourself turn into a horror slaying killing machine! But careful now, it may come with a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985860/extras/3962383f0b69dea9c8508acbd1aba3b8.poster.avif?t=1774274942\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985860/extras/3962383f0b69dea9c8508acbd1aba3b8.webm?t=1774274942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985860/extras/3962383f0b69dea9c8508acbd1aba3b8.mp4?t=1774274942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum-based responsive character movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 enemy types to test your skills</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 unique Upgrade Trees that will push the limit of your abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 playable Characters to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Lovecraftian themed levels with many different routes for replayability</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3985860?t=1774274942","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3985860?t=1774274942","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985860/759977a8256e6aee1441405166bcb9b5c6fabf59/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774274942","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985860/759977a8256e6aee1441405166bcb9b5c6fabf59/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774274942","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the end! Lovecraftian horrors